{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_30414","headline":"春尽独游慈恩寺南池 · 赵嘏","name":"春尽独游慈恩寺南池","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"竹外池塘烟雨收，送春无伴亦迟留。\n秦城马上半年客，潘鬓水边今日愁。\n气变晚云红映阙，风含高树碧遮楼。\n杏园花落游人尽，独爲圭峰一举头。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"赵嘏","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_30414.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_30414","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}